6. Save the `manifest.json` file and the `background.js` file in the same directory.
7. Pack your extension by creating a folder with the same name as your extension, and then placing the `manifest.json` file, the `background.js` file, and any other files your extension requires into the folder.
8. Install your extension by going to `chrome://extensions/` in the Chrome browser, enabling "Developer mode" (top right corner), and loading your extension folder.

